--- !u!114 &424661291
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 424661287}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "BAKU - Police have discovered multiple deceased individuals at an abandoned
    industrial facility outside Baku, according to sources within the Ministry of
    Interior. The discovery was made early Tuesday morning following an anonymous
    tip received by authorities.\r\n\r\nMinister of Interior Ramil Usubov confirmed
    the discovery during a brief press conference but declined to provide specific
    details about the number of victims or circumstances surrounding their deaths.\r\n\r\n\"Investigation
    is ongoing and details are being withheld to protect case integrity,\" Usubov
    stated. \"We ask the public to report any suspicious activities to authorities
    and emphasize that public safety is not at risk.\"\r\n\r\nThe facility, identified
    as the former Ny\u0259m Film Processing Plant, was abandoned in the late 1990s
    following the collapse of several state-owned industrial operations. Local residents
    reported increased police presence in the area since Tuesday morning.\r\n\r\nA
    special task force has been formed to investigate the incident, according to
    police sources who spoke on condition of anonymity. The investigation is being
    led by the Criminal Investigation Department with assistance from forensic specialists.\r\n\r\nNo
    connection has been established to other criminal cases at this time, officials
    emphasized. The abandoned facility had been scheduled for demolition as part
    of urban redevelopment plans.\r\n\r\nThis is a developing story. The Baku Daily
    Chronicle will continue to provide updates as more information becomes available."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f18086f2325d74e44ae0780d6e01dead, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -981012785349183052, guid: f18086f2325d74e44ae0780d6e01dead, type: 2}
